        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DLW7012SMTSBR, 12 Inch Decorative Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Spanish 12 Inch Door Pull is available in a wide selection of finishes so you can match your tastes. This 12 Inch Decorative Door Pull can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. it can be used as an <a href=\"/products/spanish-12-inch-appliance-pull-first-impressions-ap-dlw7012smtsbr\">Appliance Pull</a>, a shower door handle, or even on a store front. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW07-specifcations.gif?v=1704354703\" width=\"419\" height=\"286\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions DLW07 Dimensions Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/offset-12-inch-spanish-door-pull-first-impressions-dlw7012smtfbr\"><b>12 Inch Offset Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions DLW7012SMTSBR 12 Inch Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12.03\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 9.26\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.37\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW07-specifications.pdf?v=1704262222\"><b>First Impressions DLW7012SMTSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Finishes</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
