                "title": "12 Inch Decorative Door Pull",
                "description": "The Spanish 12 Inch Door Pull is available in a wide selection of finishes so you can match your tastes. This 12 Inch Decorative Door Pull can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. it can be used as an appliance pull, a shower door handle, or even on a store front. \r\n",
